Runtime libraries (self hosted under static/vendor/ and served from this site; nothing is fetched from another host)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@cantoo/pdf-lib 2.6.5: https://github.com/cantoo-scribe/pdf-lib
Copyright (c) 2019 Andrew Dillon; fork maintained by Cantoo
MIT

    The PDF engine: draws the sheet, embeds the logo and the fonts. The packages bundled inside it are listed below;
    the bundle keeps the notices that crypto-js's RIPEMD-160 and counter mode files carry.

@pdf-lib/fontkit 1.1.1: https://github.com/Hopding/fontkit
Copyright (c) 2014-2017 Devon Govett
MIT

    Font embedding for the wider letter set (Liberation Sans). The packages bundled inside it are listed below.

pdfjs-dist 4.0.379: https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
Copyright (c) Mozilla and individual contributors
Apache License, Version 2.0

    Draws the live preview onto a canvas. Vendored as static/vendor/pdfjs.mjs and pdfjs.worker.mjs
    (the site-wide shared copy). isEvalSupported: false is passed at the call site, so CVE-2024-4367
    (eval-based code execution in pdf.js before 4.2.67) does not apply here even though this pinned
    version predates that fix; the Content-Security-Policy also carries no unsafe-eval.

